-- Seed 50 books with real ISBN-13s so the OpenLibrary Covers API
-- (https://covers.openlibrary.org) returns real book art. Free, no auth.
-- Idempotent: re-runnable thanks to ON CONFLICT (isbn) DO NOTHING.
--
-- Run from psql:   \i supabase/seed.sql
-- Or in Supabase Studio SQL editor: paste & run.

ON CONFLICT (isbn) DO NOTHING;
